TanStack Start 1.x. Router answers 404 for notFound() and 500 for an uncaught loader/beforeLoad error before the response is committed, so NEVER catch a dependency error in a loader and return data or throw notFound() (RTE-007). Do not set `ssr: false` on public routes (RTE-002). Root `shellComponent` wraps component, errorComponent and notFoundComponent, so the site chrome is shared; nested routes without their own boundary bubble up to the root ones.
